{"type":"message","id":"4a2c26ce","parentId":"50fb9d07","timestamp":"2026-06-04T06:25:56.118Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-06-04 06:25 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Draft the article at `/tmp/crypto-run-20260604-055346/article/final.md` on WordPress using the REST API (draft status). The category is \"regulation\" (slug \"regulation\"). Upload the image `/tmp/crypto-run-20260604-055346/article/feature_placeholder.png` as the featured image if it exists. DO NOT publish it yet. Write ONLY the final WordPress draft URL to `/tmp/wp-result.txt` and yield SUCCESS."}],"timestamp":1780554356080}}
